  "identity": "GU Terravore graveyard-lands tempo with a light black splash. Self-mill and land-sacrifice (Millikin, Crop Rotation, Terminal Moraine, Polluted Mire) plus cyclers stock lands into graveyards, growing Terravore into a real threat by turn 4-5 alongside threshold beaters (Werebear, Seton's Desire) and a Squirrel Nest token clock. Bounce and permission (Man-o'-War, Snap, Counterspell, Circular Logic) plus a black splash for Chainer's Edict (edict removal) and Urborg Uprising (recursion) protect and rebuild the clock, and Life // Death animates all your lands for a lethal alpha swing.",
